---
import BaseLayout from "../components/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout current="" title="Affiliate disclosure — Small Space Tech"
  description="How Small Space Tech makes money, and what that does and doesn't change.">
  <article class="wrap" style="padding-top:56px">
    <div class="post-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
      <h1>Affiliate disclosure</h1>
      <p class="standfirst">How this site makes money, and what that does and doesn't change about what you read.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p>Some links on Small Space Tech are affiliate links. If you buy through one, the retailer may pay us a small commission. It costs you nothing extra and the price you pay is the same.</p>
      <h2>What that doesn't change</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>We only write about products we bought with our own money and used ourselves.</li>
        <li>No retailer or brand sees a review before it publishes, and none can pay for placement.</li>
        <li>When a product turns out to be a poor buy, that goes in the review.</li>
        <li>When a product is discontinued we say so, rather than swapping in a link that still pays.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>If anything here is unclear, get in touch and we'll answer plainly.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
